From: Amphoze <184834775+Amphoze@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] query: further cases of the path to postgres-meta

A statement that was never sent is on no record, and one sent twice is on record twice; a
call site's wish for the read-only login reaches the call; a request's later call is not cut
by the bound of its first; the byte bound holds for an answer that does not announce its
size; a handler that catches a refused call holds no slot; an audit file that is a pipe,
unread or held full, is refused at once; many projects at once on both instances keep to
their own; an error a statement raises under the code or the text of a refused login is not
taken for one.
---
